rned with having some extra  libraries installed that you don't use  anaconda can be a great choice since it  leads to a simpler workflow for your  needs and preferences but if you're  someone who loves to customize your  environment and make it exactly like how  you want it then perhaps something like  virtual lab or even  maybe more to your liking there's no one  right way to manage Python libraries and  there's certainly more out there than  the options that I just presented as  different tools come and go it's  important to remember that everyone has  different needs and preferences so  choose for yourself what tools out there  serve you best so what does your Python  environment look like how do you keep it  from getting out of control  share your setup in the comments below  thanks for watching this episode of  cloud AI adventures be sure to subscribe  to the channel to catch future episodes  as they come out
 

